  "body": "Opening CR3 files in order to edit results in a completely white image. As seen in the photo, the EXIF data is detected and the thumbnails of photos that haven't been opened are perfectly fine.\n\n<img width=\"2559\" height=\"1392\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a5ba3e1-6d53-4c17-8cef-82ed8cfcd7ba\" />\n\nThe image is not overexposed, lowering the exposure results in this:\n\n<img width=\"2559\" height=\"1395\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f317d7af-6fe8-412f-a0eb-df170274bcbb\" />\n\nThis is the latest version of ART (1.26.6), I reinstalled the software completely -- didn't fix the issue.\n\nCurrently running Windows 11 on an x64 system.",
